  "description_html": "<section aria-labelledby=\"courseDescription\">\n    ACTS Common Course - PHYS 2034.\n\nCo-requisite: MATH 2914 and PHYS 2000.\n\nThis course is designed for physics and engineering majors and focuses on introductory mechanics including kinematics, force, energy, work, and conservation of linear and angular momentum. Heat and fluids are also introduced.\n\nLecture and laboratory. $40 laboratory fee.\n    \n</section>",
